  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitating a mission of the private sector and the Department of Agriculture and Rural Development (DARD) to the Netherlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitating a mission of the private sector and the Department of Agriculture and Rural Development (DARD) to the Netherlands on knowledge exchange and technology transfer.The project aims to initiate and facilitate knowledge exchange and technology transfer from the Netherlands to Vietnam in horticulture and animal breeding through meetings and matchmaking sessions. A successful mission can help to create export and investment opportunities for Dutch businesses interested in doing business with Vietnam.The purpose of this trip complies with the scope and purpose of the Strategic Partnership Arrangement, specifically in the sustainable development of the horticulture and animal breeding industry.</narrative>
  </description>
